when you see these stars?

536
00:33:52,272 --> 00:33:53,439
You tell me

537
00:33:53,731 --> 00:33:54,814
What goes on in your head?

538
00:33:56,480 --> 00:33:58,856
If we miss someone very dear to us

539
00:33:59,064 --> 00:34:00,731
Even if distance separates us

540
00:34:00,814 --> 00:34:02,981
That person will also
be seeing the same stars

541
00:34:03,480 --> 00:34:05,731
I'll feel he or she is close to me

542
00:34:06,188 --> 00:34:07,314
What logic!

543
00:34:15,731 --> 00:34:18,439
Won't it be awesome
if we can be like this lifelong?

544
00:34:24,564 --> 00:34:25,772
What happened?

545
00:34:26,314 --> 00:34:27,355
No

546
00:34:27,856 --> 00:34:29,105
No...nothing

547
00:34:37,064 --> 00:34:39,564
No one has gone out of their way
this much for me

548
00:34:43,355 --> 00:34:45,147
I...love you, Shiva

549
00:34:47,064 --> 00:34:49,023
Don't play the fool, Sadhana

550
00:34:49,355 --> 00:34:50,355
Shiva

551
00:34:52,355 --> 00:34:54,147
I was not fooling around

552
00:34:54,188 --> 00:34:55,772
I mean it from the bottom of my heart

553
00:34:57,023 --> 00:35:00,023
When I think of my future
I'll think of only I, me, myself

554
00:35:00,522 --> 00:35:02,731
But now whatever I do
or wherever I go

555
00:35:03,064 --> 00:35:05,314
I feel it will be so good
if you are with me

556
00:35:05,731 --> 00:35:08,230
Whatever I think of
automatically my mind includes you

557
00:35:09,272 --> 00:35:10,355
Sadhana

558
00:35:10,564 --> 00:35:12,355
I don't think this is love

559
00:35:12,772 --> 00:35:14,689
No, Shiva
I know this for sure

560
00:35:14,731 --> 00:35:16,023
You like me too

561
00:35:16,689 --> 00:35:17,814
I like you

562
00:35:18,731 --> 00:35:20,647
You are a good friend
to me, Sadhana

563
00:35:20,689 --> 00:35:21,856
Friend?

564
00:35:23,105 --> 00:35:26,397
That night in my apartment
Is that how you behave with your friend?

565
00:35:26,731 --> 00:35:28,314
It was...at that moment

566
00:35:28,897 --> 00:35:29,981
I got it

567
00:35:30,689 --> 00:35:32,147
You just wanted fun

568
00:35:32,188 --> 00:35:35,064
As soon as I said, love and commitment
you are behaving like a stranger

569
00:35:35,272 --> 00:35:36,439
Sadhana

570
00:35:37,856 --> 00:35:39,647
Love is too big a word

571
00:35:40,939 --> 00:35:42,355
Don't use it so casually

572
00:35:43,188 --> 00:35:44,272
Never expected

573
00:35:45,397 --> 00:35:47,564
I never expected you
to say this casually to me

574
00:35:50,230 --> 00:35:51,939
Then why did you do all this, Shiva?

575
00:35:51,981 --> 00:35:53,230
You brought me here

576
00:35:53,272 --> 00:35:55,647
You told me a story
about Love constellation

577
00:35:56,147 --> 00:35:58,772
When I professed my love
why do you behave so weirdly?

578
00:35:59,856 --> 00:36:02,188
Getting entangled into
all this love, relationship

579
00:36:03,147 --> 00:36:04,522
When it ends in a break up

580
00:36:04,731 --> 00:36:06,605
I can't bear all that pain, Sadhana

581
00:36:06,772 --> 00:36:08,147
I don't have that strength

582
00:36:08,314 --> 00:36:10,314
But our relationship
won't end in a break up

583
00:36:13,856 --> 00:36:15,522
Everyone says this

584
00:36:17,564 --> 00:36:20,188
You came here running away from
marriage and commitment, no?

585
00:36:20,731 --> 00:36:21,772
Then what?

586
00:36:21,856 --> 00:36:24,147
All that...only till I befriended you

587
00:36:25,188 --> 00:36:27,564
Now I feel my life is made
if you are with me

588
00:36:28,064 --> 00:36:29,064
Lifelong

589
00:36:29,772 --> 00:36:31,439
Sounds good as a dialog

590
00:36:33,439 --> 00:36:35,314
But whoever expresses
all these words

591
00:36:36,147 --> 00:36:37,605
Being really happy together

592
00:36:38,314 --> 00:36:39,355
I haven't seen

593
00:36:40,731 --> 00:36:42,480
I thought you are a romantic guy

594
00:36:44,272 --> 00:36:45,731
You are very practical

595
00:36:48,605 --> 00:36:50,480
I...I shouldn't have told you

596
00:36:51,939 --> 00:36:53,023
My fault

597
00:36:56,023 --> 00:36:57,147
Sadhana

598
00:37:01,023 --> 00:37:02,188
Her name

599
00:37:03,939 --> 00:37:05,023
Sahithya

600
00:37:41,605 --> 00:37:47,981
"Before a second fades from view
my love, I am lost inside of you"

601
00:37:48,397 --> 00:37:54,314
"Upon the path you choose to tread
I stretch my soul, by love I am led"

602
00:37:55,272 --> 00:38:02,023
"Your talking-eyes kidnap my soul
Melting in your love, I lose control"

603
00:38:02,147 --> 00:38:07,856
"Mesmerized by your voice I seek
I live within the words you speak"

604
00:38:08,897 --> 00:38:12,355
"Your gaze is like a misty spray
Refreshing my weary heart today"

605
00:38:12,397 --> 00:38:18,981
"Your words become a tidal sway
A sea sweeping my soul away"

606
00:38:20,522 --> 00:38:26,856
"To stay within your gaze, I plead
To be your eyelids is all I need"

607
00:38:27,355 --> 00:38:33,230
"Like a wave, you touch, flow and ebb
I wane away in my own love-web"

608
00:38:34,230 --> 00:38:40,689
"To play with fingers, sweet caresses
I long to share a long path of happiness"

609
00:38:41,064 --> 00:38:46,605
"A hundred stories waiting to be told
I ask for time; our love to unfold"

610
00:39:15,314 --> 00:39:17,480
'Our life was going smooth,
in fact, on oiled wheels'

611
00:39:17,856 --> 00:39:19,480
'Till the matter of career came up'

612
00:39:20,314 --> 00:39:22,230
'Your academic records are very good'

613
00:39:22,355 --> 00:39:23,772
'It's really impressive'

614
00:39:29,355 --> 00:39:31,272
Good, do you have
any questions for us?

615
00:39:31,314 --> 00:39:32,314
Sir

616
00:39:32,647 --> 00:39:34,064
In your Coimbatore branch

617
00:39:34,272 --> 00:39:35,605
Can I get a placement?

618
00:39:36,314 --> 00:39:39,272
Working in Delhi
leaving my girlfriend behind

619
