Only that will work out

630
00:40:04,522 --> 00:40:06,230
Okay, show me your documents

631
00:40:07,605 --> 00:40:10,188
- Give
- I didn't attend the interview, Shiva

632
00:40:11,147 --> 00:40:12,731
I intend pursuing M.S in USA

633
00:40:12,772 --> 00:40:14,314
I had to process my Visa this morning

634
00:40:14,355 --> 00:40:16,897
- That's why I didn't attend your call
- U.S...?!

635
00:40:18,272 --> 00:40:20,439
You never told me anything
about this new plan

636
00:40:20,814 --> 00:40:22,772
It was a sudden plan for me too

637
00:40:22,897 --> 00:40:25,272
I thought I'll let you know
after everything got confirmed

638
00:40:26,147 --> 00:40:28,147
I needed to be with you in the same city

639
00:40:28,314 --> 00:40:30,397
So I declined my job offer in Delhi

640
00:40:30,856 --> 00:40:32,522
You're now telling me this U.S plan

641
00:40:33,064 --> 00:40:35,772
First go and find a way
to retrieve that offer

642
00:40:36,230 --> 00:40:38,897
I would've applied for a job in U.S.A
if you had told me, no?

643
00:40:39,814 --> 00:40:41,355
Be practical, Shiva

644
00:40:42,355 --> 00:40:44,856
How can you be
without considering me, Sahi?

645
00:40:46,397 --> 00:40:49,355
Doesn't look like I feature
in your future plans?

646
00:40:50,272 --> 00:40:53,064
Don't over-think and
assume unnecessarily

647
