She says she wants
to go to USA, ma

648
00:41:01,064 --> 00:41:02,731
She has gone up to applying for a Visa

649
00:41:02,772 --> 00:41:04,605
She didn't utter a single word
to me, you know

650
00:41:04,647 --> 00:41:06,605
She will anyway come back
after studying there

651
00:41:07,480 --> 00:41:10,188
Hey! America is right here, da

652
00:41:10,605 --> 00:41:12,647
Go and see her whenever
you miss her too much

653
00:41:12,856 --> 00:41:15,064
Even I can come with you once

654
