Instead of helping her pack to go to USA
you are sulking with this long a face

655
00:41:21,064 --> 00:41:23,147
Waste boyfriend, cha!

656
00:41:24,522 --> 00:41:25,647
Forget it

657
00:41:25,689 --> 00:41:27,230
Even now it isn't too late

658
00:41:27,439 --> 00:41:29,439
I saw this on TV the other day

659
00:41:30,023 --> 00:41:32,023
To ensure you get the U.S Visa

660
00:41:32,272 --> 00:41:34,355
Visit this temple in Tranquebar

661
00:41:35,064 --> 00:41:37,147
If you go there and pray
forget just USA

662
00:41:37,188 --> 00:41:39,064
You'll get the Visa
for anywhere in the world

663
00:41:57,064 --> 00:42:02,856
"Despite the weather; whatever
will this shared journey stretch forever?"

664
00:42:03,856 --> 00:42:09,147
"Leaning on each other's shoulder
will this love grow stronger?"

665
00:42:09,814 --> 00:42:16,314
"I lose without ever falling down
I look for you daily, all around"

666
00:42:16,605 --> 00:42:24,480
"You and me as 'we' I find
Love, with you my soul is entwined"

667
00:42:27,439 --> 00:42:33,564
"To stay within your gaze, I plead
To be your eyelids is all I need"

668
00:42:34,272 --> 00:42:40,064
"Like a wave, you touch, flow and ebb
I wane away in my own love-web"

669
00:42:41,147 --> 00:42:47,355
"To play with fingers, sweet caresses
I long to share a long path of happiness"

670
00:42:47,939 --> 00:42:49,856
"A hundred stories waiting to be told"

671
00:42:49,897 --> 00:42:51,439
You will get your Visa for sure

672
00:42:52,522 --> 00:42:54,064
First settle down there

673
00:42:54,272 --> 00:42:56,689
I'll come hot on your heels
with an on-site job

674
00:42:57,689 --> 00:42:59,772
What's your plan
after you finish your Masters?

675
00:43:00,939 --> 00:43:03,605
Shall we settle down
in USA...or Ooty?

676
00:43:06,230 --> 00:43:08,439
Hey...why are you so deep in thought?

677
00:43:09,439 --> 00:43:11,856
Shiva, I'm going to Ooty for 10 days

678
00:43:12,147 --> 00:43:15,147
I have to streamline
the factory and workers there

679
00:43:15,314 --> 00:43:18,147
My dad is unable to manage
everything on his own

680
00:43:18,981 --> 00:43:21,605
Is this why you were off-mood
when we were coming back?

681
00:43:23,188 --> 00:43:24,397
Don't over think

682
00:43:25,355 --> 00:43:26,439
Only 10 days

683
00:43:27,272 --> 00:43:29,147
It will fly in the blink of an eye

684
00:43:55,605 --> 00:43:57,439
Yov! Sit down, dude

685
00:43:57,480 --> 00:43:59,023
"Sahi-ye"

686
00:43:59,689 --> 00:44:01,731
Hey...hey...hey!

687
00:44:13,105 --> 00:44:14,314
HEY!

688
00:44:20,355 --> 00:44:21,939
Nothing major, no?

689
00:44:22,272 --> 00:44:23,647
Slight headache

690
00:44:29,772 --> 00:44:30,981
- Let me ride
- Hey...hey!

691
