I warned you not to sing, no?

692
00:44:43,856 --> 00:44:45,147
Lunatic

693
00:44:46,023 --> 00:44:47,272
I'll go meet her

694
00:44:48,064 --> 00:44:49,272
You

695
00:44:49,981 --> 00:44:51,147
Take some rest

696
00:44:52,439 --> 00:44:53,772
Get your bike back in shape

697
