How will I get my bike repaired here?

698
00:45:00,647 --> 00:45:01,647
Hey! Shiva

699
00:45:38,064 --> 00:45:39,647
- Sahi?
- Shiva!

700
00:45:40,272 --> 00:45:42,605
- What are you doing here?
- You are busy 24x7

701
00:45:42,981 --> 00:45:45,939
That's why I wanted to give you
a pleasant surprise in person

702
00:45:47,647 --> 00:45:49,814
- Where are you now?
- Close to your place

703
00:45:49,856 --> 00:45:52,439
Shiva, dad is here
Don't come now

704
00:45:52,772 --> 00:45:54,023
Just go back

705
00:45:54,064 --> 00:45:55,147
We'll meet in Chennai

706
00:45:55,188 --> 00:45:56,564
Ahaaan! No way

707
00:45:56,856 --> 00:45:57,939
I have to see you

708
00:45:58,105 --> 00:46:00,188
I couldn't concentrate at all
on anything, you know

709
00:46:00,897 --> 00:46:02,023
I'm coming

710
00:46:02,897 --> 00:46:04,647
Okay, don't come home

711
00:46:04,981 --> 00:46:06,147
Come to that tree-spot

712
00:46:26,814 --> 00:46:27,856
Sahi

713
00:46:28,480 --> 00:46:29,564
What's up?

714
00:46:29,772 --> 00:46:30,939
Why are you so tense?

715
00:46:36,689 --> 00:46:39,272
You know how these past 10 days
without you was so tough for me?

716
00:46:41,064 --> 00:46:43,230
I don't know how I'll manage
long distance relationship

717
00:46:43,272 --> 00:46:45,439
Let's not be together any longer, Shiva

718
00:46:47,647 --> 00:46:48,897
Let's break up

719
