But I thought long and hard about us

724
00:47:02,772 --> 00:47:04,023
Let's break up

725
00:47:05,439 --> 00:47:08,897
I can't envisage a future
with the two of us together, Shiva

726
00:47:09,188 --> 00:47:10,230
Sahi

727
