You don't understand, Shiva

729
00:47:19,064 --> 00:47:23,230
Our view towards love and relationship
is diametrically opposite

730
00:47:24,564 --> 00:47:25,772
For me

731
00:47:26,064 --> 00:47:29,564
I am unable to give you
what you expect in this relationship, Shiva

732
00:47:30,064 --> 00:47:32,272
Sahi, I don't expect anything from you

733
