Small moments we share in our life

734
00:47:34,647 --> 00:47:36,230
Enjoy our closeness

735
00:47:36,272 --> 00:47:37,814
To be with you-
By your side

736
00:47:38,230 --> 00:47:39,564
That's enough for me, Sahi

737
00:47:39,605 --> 00:47:42,856
1000 days since we first met

738
00:47:42,939 --> 00:47:45,188
To me, it is normal, Shiva

739
00:47:46,314 --> 00:47:49,731
You celebrate it in a big way
and you give me a gift

740
00:47:49,814 --> 00:47:51,272
No, Shiva
That-

741
00:47:51,772 --> 00:47:53,564
That's the difference I'm talking about

742
00:47:56,355 --> 00:47:59,188
When you go out of your way for me

743
00:47:59,230 --> 00:48:00,605
I haven't reciprocated

744
00:48:00,647 --> 00:48:02,731
That thought guilts me like hell, Shiva

745
00:48:04,439 --> 00:48:05,564
Sahi...Sahi

746
00:48:06,188 --> 00:48:08,147
Don't overthink and
complicate matters, please

747
00:48:08,439 --> 00:48:10,731
Whatever it is, we can discuss
and sort things out, Sahi

748
00:48:12,772 --> 00:48:16,981
In these 3 years, wherever I turn
I see only you in my life, Shiva

749
00:48:18,939 --> 00:48:20,023
Enough

750
00:48:21,397 --> 00:48:24,188
I was able to realize
only these past 10 days

751
00:48:25,480 --> 00:48:27,147
I was very relaxed

752
00:48:27,188 --> 00:48:29,856
I could think things over patiently

753
00:48:32,064 --> 00:48:34,188
I have to focus a little
on myself now

754
00:48:34,355 --> 00:48:36,230
I...need to plan a little

755
00:48:36,480 --> 00:48:39,647
I need to plan my future
I need...space to do so

756
00:48:47,522 --> 00:48:48,814
[sobbing]

757
00:48:50,397 --> 00:48:52,355
Don't be rash and
impulsive in deciding, Sahi

758
00:48:53,772 --> 00:48:54,981
If you like

759
00:48:56,772 --> 00:48:58,522
If you want we will take a break

760
00:49:00,064 --> 00:49:02,064
But don't say you want
a total break up

761
00:49:02,772 --> 00:49:03,897
Please

762
00:49:03,939 --> 00:49:06,689
I've been in a relationship
for 3 years, Shiva

763
00:49:06,814 --> 00:49:09,647
Even for me this is
very hurtful and painful

764
00:49:09,939 --> 00:49:11,772
But I can't handle this anymore

765
00:49:12,856 --> 00:49:14,439
It's eating my brain!

766
00:49:14,856 --> 00:49:16,105
I can't breathe

767
00:49:21,605 --> 00:49:23,814
Our priorities are totally different

768
00:49:24,522 --> 00:49:25,731
This won't work

769
00:49:25,772 --> 00:49:27,897
Let's stop now right here

770
00:49:28,064 --> 00:49:30,188
I think that's best for both of us

771
00:49:45,480 --> 00:49:46,647
[sobbing]

772
00:49:47,397 --> 00:49:48,480
Don't cry

773
00:49:51,147 --> 00:49:52,522
'Don't cry, Sahi'

774
00:49:54,564 --> 00:49:56,147
If I make you so unhappy

775
00:49:58,564 --> 00:50:00,023
I won't see you hereafter

776
00:50:09,856 --> 00:50:11,272
[sobbing loudly]

777
00:50:18,064 --> 00:50:19,981
It's all in the past now
Move on, Shiva

778
00:50:20,397 --> 00:50:21,439
Anki

779
00:50:21,480 --> 00:50:22,897
He's opening only now

780
00:50:31,355 --> 00:50:34,814
I can't convince you
we'll never break-up, Shiva

781
00:50:38,522 --> 00:50:39,981
But like you suggested

782
00:50:40,230 --> 00:50:41,689
I can't remain as just your friend

783
00:50:42,230 --> 00:50:43,647
And you know that very well

784
