Pccht! Shut up
I like red

790
00:51:21,564 --> 00:51:22,772
Then why ask me?

791
00:51:23,731 --> 00:51:25,397
Girls, pack your bags

792
00:51:25,439 --> 00:51:27,355
[Malayalam] I'm in a hurry to go
Get up and come

793
00:51:27,397 --> 00:51:28,981
I'm hungry, chechi

794
00:51:29,023 --> 00:51:30,647
Let's go to Tamil Bhavan

795
00:51:30,689 --> 00:51:33,439
Time for some crispy 'dosa'

796
00:51:37,731 --> 00:51:40,856
Don't be so stubborn, dear
Get up and come

797
00:51:41,314 --> 00:51:43,272
No, chechi
You go, I'm not coming

798
00:51:46,897 --> 00:51:47,939
You sure?

799
00:51:47,981 --> 00:51:49,064
Yeah, very sure

800
00:51:49,147 --> 00:51:50,439
I have some more work to be done

801
00:51:51,689 --> 00:51:53,814
[Malayalam] This is
not right, dear, let's go

802
00:52:37,272 --> 00:52:38,772
Your friends have come there

803
00:52:39,564 --> 00:52:40,814
Why didn't you come?

804
00:52:41,272 --> 00:52:42,814
I didn't feel like coming, that's all

805
00:52:46,731 --> 00:52:47,939
Why did you come here?

806
00:52:49,814 --> 00:52:52,355
Will your hotel personally
come and fetch customers to eat?

807
00:53:02,147 --> 00:53:03,188
Hereafter

808
00:53:04,689 --> 00:53:07,314
Whatever you want to think
add me in your thoughts too, okay?

809
00:53:13,023 --> 00:53:14,188
What did you say?

810
00:53:16,439 --> 00:53:18,897
Hereafter, whatever you want to think

811
00:53:19,772 --> 00:53:22,064
Add me in your thoughts too, okay?

812
00:53:31,564 --> 00:53:32,605
Shiva?!

813
00:53:34,814 --> 00:53:37,897
"Kith and kin gathered to celebrate"

814
00:53:39,564 --> 00:53:42,397
"Joys multiplied to escalate"

815
