"Why did he call her 'wife'?
WIth him through every striFE"

822
00:54:17,814 --> 00:54:22,147
"Why did he call himself 'spouse'?
Makes a home SPecial from hOUSE"

823
00:54:22,564 --> 00:54:26,188
"Together they are
made for each other"

824
00:54:27,188 --> 00:54:31,772
"She is the anchor steady & steadfast
for the wave-length to settle at last"

825
00:54:31,856 --> 00:54:33,939
"Oh my goodness!
This graceful princess"

826
00:54:33,981 --> 00:54:36,772
"She stood before him beaming bright
like many a moon radiating light"

827
00:54:36,856 --> 00:54:41,230
"Our families unite, near & dear
Million joys echoing cheer"

828
00:54:41,439 --> 00:54:46,230
"Hundred rumors here and there
Loaded with love clearing the air"

829
00:55:15,731 --> 00:55:17,480
Do you remember
what's special about today?

830
00:55:17,605 --> 00:55:18,647
What?

831
00:55:20,522 --> 00:55:21,814
Happy anniversary

832
00:55:22,314 --> 00:55:26,856
"A sudden feeling unprecedented
Heart & mind soulfully contented"

833
00:55:27,064 --> 00:55:31,397
"Wonder what you did to me
This blissful bond now in reality"

834
00:55:32,023 --> 00:55:36,522
"You and me should be 'we' truly precious
as vermillion & turmeric blend auspicious"

835
00:55:36,731 --> 00:55:41,147
"A photograph picture perfect
as love and laughter reflect"

836
00:55:41,480 --> 00:55:44,355
"Blessings from the family
to the couple so love-ly"

837
00:55:45,230 --> 00:55:50,522
"She is the anchor, grounded and ready
as the tides in his heart settle & steady"

838
00:55:50,772 --> 00:55:52,689
"Oh my goodness!
This graceful princess"

839
00:55:52,731 --> 00:55:55,731
"She stood before him beaming bright
like many a moon radiating light"

840
00:55:55,772 --> 00:56:00,147
"Our families unite, near & dear
Million joys echoing cheer"

841
00:56:00,355 --> 00:56:04,897
"Hundred rumors here and there
Loaded with love clearing the air"

842
00:56:05,023 --> 00:56:09,731
"Our families unite, near & dear
Million joys echoing cheer"

843
00:56:09,814 --> 00:56:14,647
"Tongues wagging everywhere
Love steps in to clear the air"

844
00:57:32,064 --> 00:57:33,147
'Thank God!'

845
00:57:33,897 --> 00:57:36,023
'He was admitted
in the nick of time'

846
00:57:36,689 --> 00:57:38,064
Don't be scared or worried

847
00:57:39,480 --> 00:57:40,897
We are there for you

848
00:57:41,689 --> 00:57:44,064
He will be perfectly fine

849
00:57:45,064 --> 00:57:47,480
Wait and watch, he will
be discharged very soon

850
00:57:48,522 --> 00:57:49,939
- Sir?
- Yes, doctor

851
00:57:49,981 --> 00:57:52,564
Aren't you the attendant
for the patient in #604?

852
00:57:52,647 --> 00:57:54,522
He doesn't have major external injuries

853
00:57:54,564 --> 00:57:57,147
But because of the concussion
in his head in the accident

854
00:57:57,272 --> 00:57:58,772
There's a blood clot in his brain

855
00:57:58,856 --> 00:58:00,272
That's why he's unconscious

856
00:58:00,314 --> 00:58:02,605
We are trying to increase
the anticoagulants dosage

857
00:58:02,814 --> 00:58:04,188
Let's wait for 3-4 days

858
00:58:05,272 --> 00:58:07,981
If he doesn't regain consciousness
surgery is the last option

859
00:58:08,981 --> 00:58:10,731
Surgery is only 50-50 chance

860
00:58:10,981 --> 00:58:12,439
Even if he survives

861
00:58:12,480 --> 00:58:14,397
There are more chances for him to be

862
00:58:14,439 --> 00:58:15,897
Paralyzed completely

863
00:58:49,355 --> 00:58:50,856
Who is Shiva's attendant?

864
00:58:51,397 --> 00:58:52,981
Patient is conscious now

865
00:58:53,314 --> 00:58:54,355
Heard that, dear?

866
00:58:56,230 --> 00:58:57,397
Come, dear

867
00:59:01,522 --> 00:59:02,772
How are you feeling?

868
00:59:04,522 --> 00:59:05,772
What is your name?

869
00:59:06,023 --> 00:59:07,147
Shiva

870
00:59:07,314 --> 00:59:08,314
Good

871
00:59:08,731 --> 00:59:10,314
Stretch out your hand

872
00:59:11,355 --> 00:59:12,522
Slowly

873
00:59:12,897 --> 00:59:15,064
Any pain or do you feel any difference?

874
00:59:15,397 --> 00:59:17,439
- I'm okay, doctor
- Okay

875
00:59:19,355 --> 00:59:20,397
Shiva...?

876
00:59:22,272 --> 00:59:23,605
You are fine now?

877
00:59:24,188 --> 00:59:25,397
I was petrified

878
00:59:27,272 --> 00:59:29,188
Is my friend alright, doctor?

879
00:59:29,814 --> 00:59:31,023
Just relax

880
00:59:32,647 --> 00:59:33,731
Shiva?

881
00:59:38,355 --> 00:59:39,397
Doctor?

882
00:59:39,731 --> 00:59:41,564
Can you send my family in?

883
00:59:42,480 --> 00:59:43,480
'Sure'

884
00:59:44,522 --> 00:59:45,731
What's wrong with you?

885
00:59:45,772 --> 00:59:47,272
Why aren't you talking to me?

886
00:59:47,689 --> 00:59:48,772
Who are you?

887
00:59:49,522 --> 00:59:50,814
Don't play the fool

888
00:59:51,064 --> 00:59:52,605
- My son
- Shiva

889
00:59:52,814 --> 00:59:55,564
- Maa!
- Came home after so many months

890
00:59:55,605 --> 00:59:57,522
Why should I see you like this?

891
00:59:57,981 --> 01:00:00,522
- Doctor, he will be fine, right?
- He is recovering

892
01:00:00,689 --> 01:00:02,605
Ma, don't cry

893
01:00:03,064 --> 01:00:04,272
I'm fine

894
01:00:04,314 --> 01:00:06,397
You'll be fine, dear

895
01:00:06,856 --> 01:00:09,230
This Mani is the one to blame
for this accident

896
01:00:09,272 --> 01:00:10,355
'Mani?'

897
01:00:10,605 --> 01:00:11,731
Shiva?

898
01:00:12,605 --> 01:00:13,731
Dude?

899
01:00:14,355 --> 01:00:15,397
Are you okay?

900
01:00:15,480 --> 01:00:16,522
Hey!

901
01:00:17,147 --> 01:00:18,647
Why have you tonsured your head?

902
01:00:19,522 --> 01:00:20,856
Tonsured my head?

903
01:00:25,522 --> 01:00:26,689
By the way

904
01:00:27,188 --> 01:00:28,814
How is it nothing happened to you?

905
01:00:29,397 --> 01:00:30,689
What should happen to me?

906
01:00:32,856 --> 01:00:34,814
Ma, just listen to him

907
01:00:34,897 --> 01:00:36,939
He's cleverly covering up his fault

908
01:00:40,105 --> 01:00:41,605
She will come and ask you

909
01:00:42,147 --> 01:00:43,314
You face the music

910
01:00:44,188 --> 01:00:45,647
Hey! Who is that 'she'?

911
01:00:46,105 --> 01:00:47,939
Shiva, what are you blabbering?

912
01:00:47,981 --> 01:00:49,023
Relax, son

913
01:00:49,230 --> 01:00:50,605
Doctor, is he alright?

914
01:00:50,647 --> 01:00:52,439
Hello! Who are you?!

915
01:00:53,772 --> 01:00:55,147
Why are you so concerned?

916
01:00:55,188 --> 01:00:56,939
- Shiva!
- 'What is all this, da?'

917
01:00:58,355 --> 01:00:59,397
Dai!

918
01:00:59,647 --> 01:01:00,939
Where is Sahithya?

919
01:01:03,355 --> 01:01:04,397
Sahithya?

920
01:01:06,564 --> 01:01:07,605
'Relax'

921
01:01:07,689 --> 01:01:09,064
Did you even inform her?

922
01:01:13,188 --> 01:01:14,272
What?

923
01:01:15,230 --> 01:01:16,355
You didn't tell her?

924
01:01:20,147 --> 01:01:21,605
She doesn't know?

925
01:01:21,689 --> 01:01:23,814
Dude, calm down

926
01:01:30,147 --> 01:01:32,480
Not being with me for 10 days
I know she would've missed me

927
01:01:33,480 --> 01:01:34,897
And this had to happen!

928
01:01:38,397 --> 01:01:39,689
It's okay, let it be

929
01:01:41,147 --> 01:01:43,064
If she sees me like this

930
01:01:43,731 --> 01:01:45,064
She won't be able to take it

931
01:01:48,147 --> 01:01:49,230
Doctor

932
01:01:50,023 --> 01:01:51,939
Can I travel in this condition?

933
01:01:53,772 --> 01:01:55,689
My girlfriend will be waiting for me

934
01:01:55,772 --> 01:01:56,856
'Don't worry'

935
01:01:56,897 --> 01:01:59,023
- 'You'll be alright
- Sadhana'

936
01:01:59,772 --> 01:02:01,981
Should all this happen
when she is leaving for USA?

937
01:02:38,731 --> 01:02:39,856
Hey!

938
01:02:40,064 --> 01:02:41,480
Why are you looking at her weirdly?

939
01:02:41,522 --> 01:02:42,564
Sadhana, dude

940
01:02:42,772 --> 01:02:44,522
Just like me she's also
your close friend

941
01:02:47,147 --> 01:02:48,647
Then do you know Sahithya?

942
01:02:54,981 --> 01:02:57,064
By the way, what do you do now?

943
01:02:57,188 --> 01:02:58,689
I run a restaurant

944
01:02:58,981 --> 01:03:00,480
Ankitha and I are married

945
01:03:00,564 --> 01:03:01,856
We run it together

946
01:03:01,897 --> 01:03:03,480
- Ankitha and you?!
- Yes, da

947
01:03:06,272 --> 01:03:07,856
There's a limit to fibbing

948
01:03:08,230 --> 01:03:10,023
You think I'll swallow
any yarn you spin?

949
01:03:10,439 --> 01:03:11,605
Get lost, fibber!

950
01:03:11,772 --> 01:03:13,480
Ankitha and he are a couple it seems

951
01:03:15,856 --> 01:03:17,564
Take a look at this
if you don't believe me

952
01:03:18,689 --> 01:03:19,897
Our wedding photo

953
01:03:24,439 --> 01:03:25,564
Take a closer look

954
01:03:39,731 --> 01:03:40,814
'Dude...?'

955
01:03:41,397 --> 01:03:43,314
- 'What happened, da?
- Shiva!'

956
01:03:43,605 --> 01:03:45,355
- Hey....hey, dude
- Shiva?'

957
01:03:47,647 --> 01:03:48,939
'He is still in shock'

958
01:03:49,522 --> 01:03:51,564
He has lost nearly 6 years
of his memory

959
01:03:52,105 --> 01:03:54,105
Even to process that
will be tough for him

960
01:03:54,689 --> 01:03:56,689
Don't introduce any new information now

961
01:03:56,731 --> 01:03:58,272
And for the time being

962
01:03:58,314 --> 01:04:01,522
It is better if he doesn't know
his girlfriend is no longer in his life

963
01:04:02,064 --> 01:04:04,105
How long do we go
with this charade, doctor?

964
01:04:04,605 --> 01:04:07,272
One day or the other anyway
won't he know the truth as it is?

965
01:04:07,731 --> 01:04:10,355
What if I tell him patiently
all that has happened?

966
01:04:12,397 --> 01:04:13,439
Listen

967
01:04:13,605 --> 01:04:16,731
When you search for a specific item
you don't remember where you've kept

968
01:04:16,772 --> 01:04:18,105
How do you feel?

969
01:04:18,647 --> 01:04:19,814
'I kept it here somewhere'

970
01:04:19,856 --> 01:04:21,689
'How can it be missing?'
This will be our mindset

971
01:04:21,731 --> 01:04:22,981
You'll be so confused

972
01:04:23,355 --> 01:04:24,605
Strain for the brain

973
01:04:25,230 --> 01:04:27,314
This is our reaction
for an ordinary item

974
01:04:27,772 --> 01:04:31,105
He has forgotten his life and
is trying to fix the jigsaw puzzle

975
01:04:32,397 --> 01:04:36,272
If we add a new information
he's unable to process in this crucial time

976
01:04:36,814 --> 01:04:39,981
He'll go into a state of not knowing
the difference between truth and lies

977
01:04:40,314 --> 01:04:41,355
And

978
01:04:41,397 --> 01:04:43,397
It may even lead to schizophrenia

979
01:04:43,605 --> 01:04:45,272
Then what is the solution, doctor?

980
01:04:45,314 --> 01:04:48,147
First to bring that girl
into his life is our best bet

981
01:04:48,772 --> 01:04:51,480
'We need to give him some time
to regain his memories'

982
01:04:51,981 --> 01:04:56,064
'And for now, better to leave him
to be himself and wait'

983
01:04:59,605 --> 01:05:00,981
'Hello?
Sahithya?'

984
01:05:01,064 --> 01:05:02,480
Um...I...am Sadhana

985
01:05:02,522 --> 01:05:05,856
- Shiva's-
- 'Ankitha told me everything'

986
01:05:06,272 --> 01:05:08,689
'I feel bad Shiva is going through this'

987
01:05:09,480 --> 01:05:12,897
'But I can't come over there
the way you expect me to'

988
01:05:13,397 --> 01:05:14,480
No, Sahithya

989
01:05:15,023 --> 01:05:18,397
Doctor feels Shiva has a better chance
of recovery if he meets you

990
01:05:18,439 --> 01:05:20,064
All you have to do is just come here

991
01:05:20,105 --> 01:05:22,731
- We will-
- 'Listen, it isn't as easy as you think'

992
01:05:22,772 --> 01:05:24,856
'Plus I don't want to
go through all of that again'

993
01:05:24,897 --> 01:05:26,023
'So, please'

994
01:05:26,981 --> 01:05:28,147
She cut the call

995
01:06:04,772 --> 01:06:06,105
Really chill, no?

996
01:06:08,023 --> 01:06:09,564
How much more do we have to travel?

997
01:06:09,939 --> 01:06:11,981
- How much further, bro?
- '20 km'

998
01:06:12,023 --> 01:06:13,272
TWENTY?!

999
01:06:38,897 --> 01:06:39,897
Hello?

1000
01:06:39,939 --> 01:06:42,647
How many times do I tell you?
Why are you hassling me?

1001
01:06:42,814 --> 01:06:44,355
Sahithya, I'm so sorry

1002
01:06:44,480 --> 01:06:46,147
Shiva is on his way to meet you

1003
01:06:46,188 --> 01:06:47,814
'We are also coming with him'

1004
01:06:47,856 --> 01:06:50,439
- 'Please help'
- Why aren't you understanding me at all?

1005
01:06:50,522 --> 01:06:53,230
- Please stop him
- I understand your mindset, Sahithya

1006
01:06:53,272 --> 01:06:57,230
We told him your dad is unwell
to try and dissuade him from this trip

1007
01:06:57,355 --> 01:06:59,605
Now he's coming to meet your dad

1008
01:06:59,772 --> 01:07:01,147
My goodness!

1009
01:07:01,480 --> 01:07:03,439
First of all my dad
isn't alive now

1010
01:07:03,480 --> 01:07:05,105
3 years since he passed away

1011
01:07:07,023 --> 01:07:08,147
I'm so sorry

1012
01:07:08,272 --> 01:07:09,480
That's not the point

1013
01:07:09,522 --> 01:07:11,188
Can you please just deal with this?

1014
01:07:11,731 --> 01:07:12,814
Please?

1015
01:07:19,023 --> 01:07:21,397
Sadhana, what happened?
What did she say?

1016
01:07:21,689 --> 01:07:23,856
She just doesn't want us to come, Mani

1017
01:07:24,772 --> 01:07:27,023
It seems her dad died
quite a few years ago

1018
01:07:27,397 --> 01:07:28,605
Are you serious?

1019
01:07:28,731 --> 01:07:30,522
'How do we manage him now?'

1020
01:07:31,731 --> 01:07:34,105
Anki told me Sahithya returned from USA

1021
01:07:34,147 --> 01:07:36,314
She is still single and
taking care of her dad's estate

1022
01:07:36,355 --> 01:07:38,064
But didn't mention about the dad dying

1023
01:07:38,147 --> 01:07:39,689
She is refusing to meet him

1024
01:07:39,731 --> 01:07:41,397
He is insisting on meeting her

1025
01:07:43,897 --> 01:07:46,480
Okay, let's go, we'll cross
the bridge when we come to it

1026
01:07:59,105 --> 01:08:00,522
Aiyaiyo!

1027
01:08:02,023 --> 01:08:03,230
Shucks!

1028
01:08:05,731 --> 01:08:07,272
Hey...hey...hey!

1029
01:08:07,605 --> 01:08:09,314
- Sahi
- Shiva!

1030
01:08:09,355 --> 01:08:10,647
'Gone case!'

1031
01:08:13,105 --> 01:08:14,814
They are filling my head
with nonsense

1032
01:08:14,981 --> 01:08:16,314
It has been 6 years it seems

1033
01:08:17,522 --> 01:08:19,230
I don't remember anything

1034
01:08:20,689 --> 01:08:22,522
Why didn't you come
to see me even once?

1035
01:08:24,355 --> 01:08:26,480
Do you know how often
I tried to talk to you?

1036
01:08:29,230 --> 01:08:30,397
Forget it

1037
01:08:30,480 --> 01:08:31,647
How is your dad?

1038
01:08:38,939 --> 01:08:40,689
Appa passed away, Shiva

1039
01:08:41,647 --> 01:08:42,731
What are you saying?

1040
01:08:43,564 --> 01:08:45,023
They said he's just unwell

1041
01:08:48,105 --> 01:08:49,188
'When Sahi?'

1042
01:08:49,522 --> 01:08:50,897
Why didn't you tell me?

1043
01:08:52,439 --> 01:08:53,564
Please

1044
01:08:56,188 --> 01:08:57,772
When you had your accident

1045
01:08:57,981 --> 01:08:59,105
At that time

1046
01:09:00,147 --> 01:09:02,188
How did you manage
everything all by yourself?

1047
01:09:03,439 --> 01:09:05,147
Okay, forget the past

1048
01:09:05,689 --> 01:09:06,814
'Let go, Shiva'

1049
01:09:07,023 --> 01:09:08,564
Enough, let go of me, Shiva

1050
01:09:10,439 --> 01:09:11,689
Shiva, move

1051
01:09:15,230 --> 01:09:16,939
I'm so sorry about uncle, Sahi

1052
01:09:17,023 --> 01:09:19,105
I couldn't come
because of this issue

1053
01:09:19,147 --> 01:09:20,230
I'm sorry

1054
01:09:21,314 --> 01:09:22,314
'Sahi'

1055
01:09:23,439 --> 01:09:24,939
I'll stay over here

1056
01:09:25,480 --> 01:09:26,814
Is there any lodge nearby?

1057
01:09:26,856 --> 01:09:28,522
- Whom is he asking for?
- These two

1058
01:09:29,064 --> 01:09:30,439
Hey!

1059
01:09:31,397 --> 01:09:33,147
Doesn't matter
All of you can stay here

1060
01:09:34,689 --> 01:09:36,272
- Muthu anna
- Yes, madam

1061
01:09:36,314 --> 01:09:38,522
- Take their luggage inside
- Okay, madam

1062
01:09:39,023 --> 01:09:40,564
- Shall we follow him?
- Okay

1063
01:09:40,605 --> 01:09:42,147
- I'll be inside
- Come, da

1064
01:09:48,981 --> 01:09:50,188
Thank you so much, Sahithya

1065
01:09:50,230 --> 01:09:51,814
I was worried
you may blow our cover

1066
01:09:51,856 --> 01:09:53,355
- Sadhana, right?
- Yeah

1067
01:09:53,772 --> 01:09:55,439
I told you not to come
and you landed here

1068
01:09:56,272 --> 01:09:57,939
We have dealt with
this situation for now

1069
01:09:57,981 --> 01:09:59,605
But don't use it to your advantage

1070
01:10:00,522 --> 01:10:02,064
I don't want to be part of this drama

1071
01:10:12,689 --> 01:10:13,772
Okay

1072
01:10:13,939 --> 01:10:15,147
Confirm the deal

1073
01:10:15,522 --> 01:10:17,023
I'll sign it tomorrow

1074
01:10:17,314 --> 01:10:18,522
'Okay, thank you'

1075
01:10:54,105 --> 01:10:55,272
Shiva?

1076
01:10:55,981 --> 01:10:57,230
What are you doing here?

1077
01:10:58,023 --> 01:11:00,731
Both of them are filling up the gaps
in bits and pieces for me

1078
01:11:00,981 --> 01:11:03,023
Only you can tell me
everything about us

1079
01:11:05,230 --> 01:11:07,689
You go back to bed now
Let's discuss this in the morning, go

1080
01:11:07,856 --> 01:11:09,023
Morning?

1081
01:11:09,856 --> 01:11:11,397
I'll spend the night here

1082
01:11:12,105 --> 01:11:14,355
First...tell me what happened

1083
01:11:16,105 --> 01:11:17,439
- Mani
- Hmm?

1084
01:11:17,564 --> 01:11:18,856
- MANI!
- Hmmm?

1085
01:11:19,856 --> 01:11:21,147
Not asleep yet?

1086
01:11:21,522 --> 01:11:23,856
I'll take care of Shiva
Have a good night's rest

1087
01:11:24,023 --> 01:11:25,230
You're taking very good care

1088
01:11:25,272 --> 01:11:27,105
He went to Sahithya's room
and shut the door!

1089
01:11:27,397 --> 01:11:29,689
Why are you waking me up
instead of knocking at that door?

1090
01:11:30,023 --> 01:11:31,439
Grrrr! MANI!

1091
01:11:31,939 --> 01:11:33,355
Come with me

1092
01:11:38,814 --> 01:11:40,439
Tell me everything
that happened to me

1093
01:11:47,272 --> 01:11:49,147
Honestly don't you remember anything?

1094
01:11:49,897 --> 01:11:50,897
Tch!

1095
01:11:51,981 --> 01:11:53,439
What's your last memory?

1096
01:11:53,689 --> 01:11:54,939
Last I remember is

1097
01:11:55,397 --> 01:11:57,814
Mani and I were coming
in a bike to meet you

1098
01:12:00,397 --> 01:12:02,480
On the way
we had an accident

1099
01:12:03,480 --> 01:12:05,439
When I got up
I'm in a hospital

1100
01:12:06,397 --> 01:12:08,023
They claim 6 years has sped past

1101
01:12:08,397 --> 01:12:09,731
That's all I remember

1102
01:12:12,439 --> 01:12:13,605
No sound at all

1103
01:12:13,647 --> 01:12:15,105
Maybe they have slept

1104
01:12:15,147 --> 01:12:17,105
You go and sleep too
We can talk in the morning

1105
01:12:19,355 --> 01:12:21,689
- Why not?
- I have another plan to disturb them

1106
01:12:22,355 --> 01:12:24,105
- What?
- I'll tell you

1107
01:12:27,314 --> 01:12:28,522
Why are you staring at me?

1108
01:12:28,564 --> 01:12:29,731
Nothing is wrong with me

1109
01:12:30,188 --> 01:12:32,147
I will be 100% fine
if I am with you

1110
01:12:32,480 --> 01:12:33,856
Come, lie down

1111
01:12:34,439 --> 01:12:37,689
Okay, tell me this
How long has it been?

1112
01:12:39,772 --> 01:12:41,272
What?
Even you forgot?

1113
01:12:41,814 --> 01:12:42,897
Come...come

1114
01:12:49,522 --> 01:12:50,731
Sorry, Sahithya

1115
01:12:50,856 --> 01:12:52,605
I mistook the door bell
for the light switch

1116
01:12:52,647 --> 01:12:54,188
What are you doing here?

1117
01:12:54,230 --> 01:12:56,439
Hey! I was looking only for you

1118
01:12:56,814 --> 01:12:58,188
Such a huge place and unfamiliar

1119
01:12:58,230 --> 01:12:59,230
I am scared, dude

1120
01:12:59,272 --> 01:13:00,689
What are you up to here?

1121
01:13:01,314 --> 01:13:03,772
I came to spend quality time with Sahithya

1122
01:13:04,480 --> 01:13:06,522
Ages since we sat and
chatted for no reason, no?

1123
01:13:06,564 --> 01:13:09,105
It would have been awesome
if Ankitha were here too

1124
01:13:09,147 --> 01:13:10,314
Sadhana

1125
01:13:10,856 --> 01:13:11,939
Sadhana, huh?

1126
01:13:12,355 --> 01:13:14,272
Shiva says we can chat for a while

1127
01:13:15,188 --> 01:13:16,272
Come, sit

1128
01:13:16,439 --> 01:13:18,314
Hey! Get up

1129
01:13:18,981 --> 01:13:20,647
- Get up
- Aren't we chatting?

1130
01:13:21,064 --> 01:13:23,188
Let's go to our room and chat

1131
01:13:23,856 --> 01:13:24,981
Sorry, Sahithya

1132
01:13:25,023 --> 01:13:27,023
- You said we can chat
- Who asked you to come?

1133
01:13:28,814 --> 01:13:30,105
Sorry, Sahithya

1134
01:13:30,605 --> 01:13:32,939
We will leave
as soon as we can

1135
01:13:33,314 --> 01:13:34,939
You don't get it, Sadhana

1136
01:13:36,188 --> 01:13:38,439
You can stay here
as friends as long as you want

1137
01:13:38,480 --> 01:13:40,188
Even I want Shiva to get better

1138
01:13:40,480 --> 01:13:42,981
But to restart and
rake up my past that's over

1139
01:13:43,105 --> 01:13:45,105
He's behaving like we are still in love

1140
01:13:45,480 --> 01:13:46,772
I am not for it

1141
01:13:47,314 --> 01:13:49,480
Just 1 week, Sahithya, please

1142
01:13:50,897 --> 01:13:52,480
You see, if he

1143
01:13:53,355 --> 01:13:55,522
If Shiva behaves like this once more

1144
01:13:55,564 --> 01:13:57,105
I might have to tell him everything

1145
01:13:57,856 --> 01:13:59,522
Don't get me wrong then

1146
01:13:59,772 --> 01:14:01,772
No, I'll make sure
you're not pushed into a spot

1147
01:14:02,439 --> 01:14:03,731
I'll handle him

1148
01:14:17,105 --> 01:14:18,731
Ooty, your beauty!

1149
01:14:19,647 --> 01:14:20,897
Mani sir

1150
01:14:20,939 --> 01:14:22,856
- Coffee
- Thank you

1151
01:14:23,105 --> 01:14:24,647
- Mutha'nna
- Sir

1152
01:14:24,689 --> 01:14:26,105
How far does our estate stretch?

1153
01:14:26,272 --> 01:14:27,731
How can you ask this?

1154
01:14:27,814 --> 01:14:30,397
Our estate extends
as far as your eyes can see

1155
01:14:36,897 --> 01:14:38,272
Uncle is calling me

1156
01:14:38,731 --> 01:14:39,897
Mani

1157
01:14:39,939 --> 01:14:41,981
- Is everything okay?
- All good

1158
01:14:42,230 --> 01:14:44,689
Did that girl agree to
have the three of you stay there?

1159
01:14:44,731 --> 01:14:46,981
Aiyo, uncle, we somehow managed to do so

1160
01:14:47,355 --> 01:14:50,731
Mani, Sadhana taking this course of action
despite the fact we told her not to

1161
01:14:50,772 --> 01:14:52,689
I don't know the result or repercussions

1162
01:14:53,105 --> 01:14:56,564
What do we do if that boy
doesn't ever remember our girl's existence?

1163
01:14:56,647 --> 01:14:59,605
Aunty, don't think that way
It won't turn into a disaster

1164
01:14:59,856 --> 01:15:01,522
She left in haste impulsively

1165
01:15:02,564 --> 01:15:03,981
- Take care of her
- Sure, I will

1166
01:15:04,023 --> 01:15:05,647
'I am banking on you'

1167
01:15:05,981 --> 01:15:08,105
Uncle, I'm getting another call
Can I call you later?

1168
01:15:08,147 --> 01:15:09,230
'Okay, Mani'

1169
01:15:09,439 --> 01:15:10,772
- Bye, uncle
- 'Bye'

1170
01:15:12,522 --> 01:15:13,939
- Hello?
- Yes, Anki

1171
01:15:14,023 --> 01:15:16,023
Whom are you talking to
early in the morning?

1172
01:15:16,064 --> 01:15:17,397
Don't even ask!

1173
01:15:17,647 --> 01:15:19,272
Sadhana's parents called me

1174
01:15:19,314 --> 01:15:21,230
They are not okay with this one bit

1175
01:15:21,272 --> 01:15:23,230
'Even I have serious doubts
of this working out'

1176
01:15:23,272 --> 01:15:24,897
He went into Sahithya's room last night

1177
01:15:25,147 --> 01:15:27,314
I don't know when
she will chase us out, Anki

1178
01:15:27,480 --> 01:15:28,522
Don't lose hope

1179
01:15:28,564 --> 01:15:30,272
I know Sahithya inside out

1180
01:15:30,522 --> 01:15:32,397
She wasn't in touch
with us all these years

1181
01:15:32,480 --> 01:15:33,522
Yes

1182
01:15:33,564 --> 01:15:36,897
And still she allowed you
to stay there is a major plus, no?

1183
01:15:37,647 --> 01:15:39,522
'It's a little tough to tackle her'

1184
01:15:39,564 --> 01:15:40,856
But not impossible

1185
01:15:40,897 --> 01:15:42,023
That's true

1186
01:15:42,230 --> 01:15:43,397
You're right about her

1187
01:15:43,439 --> 01:15:45,856
I managed you well enough
Why should I be scared of her?!

1188
01:15:46,355 --> 01:15:47,564
Such a lunatic!

1189
01:15:48,314 --> 01:15:49,689
I'm the one tackling you!

1190
01:15:50,272 --> 01:15:51,647
With both of you absent

1191
01:15:51,689 --> 01:15:53,772
'I am holding fort here
single handed here right?'

1192
01:15:53,814 --> 01:15:55,397
Are you pointing your finger at me?

1193
01:15:55,439 --> 01:15:58,522
Anki, I love you very much
You know I can't exist without you

1194
01:15:58,564 --> 01:16:00,064
Madam, vegetables have been washed

1195
01:16:00,105 --> 01:16:01,647
Wait, I'll call you back

1196
01:16:02,981 --> 01:16:04,355
Thank God she hung up

1197
01:16:04,522 --> 01:16:06,480
She can't sleep if she doesn't yell at me

1198
01:16:07,981 --> 01:16:09,605
- Yes, ma
- Mani

1199
01:16:09,647 --> 01:16:10,981
Has Shiva woken up?

1200
01:16:11,023 --> 01:16:12,480
He got up way ahead of me

1201
01:16:12,522 --> 01:16:15,772
Good improvement, he had coffee, showered
and got ready as if he's going to work

1202
01:16:15,814 --> 01:16:17,814
I'll give him the meds
after breakfast, what else?

1203
01:16:17,856 --> 01:16:18,981
Dai!

1204
01:16:19,314 --> 01:16:20,939
Instead of forgetting Sadhana

1205
01:16:20,981 --> 01:16:24,564
'If he had forgotten you, my son
would have been with me today, da'

1206
01:16:25,480 --> 01:16:28,147
You took him away to Jaipur then
Now this wild goose chase to Ooty

1207
01:16:28,272 --> 01:16:30,605
I didn't got so many calls
even when I availed a bank loan!

1208
01:16:30,647 --> 01:16:33,314
All of you call me and ask
'Did Shiva eat? Has Shiva slept?'

1209
01:16:33,355 --> 01:16:35,397
- Did any of you worry about me?
- 'Okay, forget it'

1210
01:16:35,439 --> 01:16:36,981
'How is my dear daughter-in-law?'

1211
01:16:37,064 --> 01:16:38,647
Even now you're not concerned about me!

1212
01:16:38,689 --> 01:16:41,023
Both your daughters-in-law
are asleep on the same bed!

1213
01:16:45,230 --> 01:16:47,397
Sahi...Sahi, wake up

1214
01:16:50,272 --> 01:16:51,355
'Sahi'

1215
01:16:56,147 --> 01:16:57,856
What? Slept like a baby, huh?

1216
01:17:03,023 --> 01:17:05,147
Get ready, quick
Shall we go out today?

1217
01:17:06,522 --> 01:17:08,605
Let's go to the lake
You'll feel relaxed too

1218
01:17:08,689 --> 01:17:09,856
What do you say?

1219
01:17:11,188 --> 01:17:12,272
'Shiva...?'

1220
01:17:12,564 --> 01:17:13,731
'Shiva'

1221
01:17:13,772 --> 01:17:15,064
He's a royal pain!

1222
01:17:15,188 --> 01:17:16,355
Get ready soon

1223
01:17:16,397 --> 01:17:18,314
I'll ask for the car
Get ready and come down?

1224
01:17:19,897 --> 01:17:21,188
Okay

1225
01:17:29,981 --> 01:17:31,105
Sorry

1226
01:17:34,105 --> 01:17:35,272
'Shiva?'

1227
01:17:35,355 --> 01:17:36,605
- Shiva
- Dai!

1228
01:17:37,105 --> 01:17:38,647
What the hell is your problem?

1229
01:17:38,731 --> 01:17:40,188
You keep hounding me?

1230
01:17:40,605 --> 01:17:43,230
Did you bring me here to be with Sahi
or tag behind you like a pup?

1231
01:17:43,272 --> 01:17:44,397
Why won't you accuse me?!

1232
01:17:44,439 --> 01:17:46,064
I'm the one answering everyone

1233
01:17:46,147 --> 01:17:47,188
Your amma calls me

1234
01:17:47,230 --> 01:17:49,105
Sadhana's parents are
so concerned and call me

1235
01:17:49,147 --> 01:17:50,647
On top of it Ankitha calls me

1236
01:17:51,230 --> 01:17:52,397
I'm curious

1237
01:17:52,981 --> 01:17:55,147
Why should Sadhana's parents
be concerned about me?

1238
01:17:55,814 --> 01:17:57,564
Um...er...that's-

1239
01:17:57,605 --> 01:17:59,772
Why are you ready
so early this morning?

1240
01:18:00,314 --> 01:18:01,355
I got up-

1241
01:18:01,397 --> 01:18:02,564
Sahithya is awake, right?

1242
01:18:02,605 --> 01:18:04,397
I must have 'bed coffee'
with her, that's why

1243
01:18:04,439 --> 01:18:06,188
Share coffee in bed, eh?

1244
01:18:06,522 --> 01:18:07,981
Move...move

1245
01:18:09,689 --> 01:18:11,023
Watch your step, dude

1246
01:18:11,731 --> 01:18:15,147
Why was it so late for load
to be dispatched last night?

1247
01:18:15,647 --> 01:18:18,064
Won't work get done properly
if I am not there to supervise?

1248
01:18:18,105 --> 01:18:19,939
'No, madam, load was delayed
because of load man'

1249
01:18:19,981 --> 01:18:21,480
'We dispatched it quickly after that'

1250
01:18:21,522 --> 01:18:24,188
Sekar, entry is at 3:15
in the exit register

1251
01:18:24,314 --> 01:18:25,689
2 hours late

1252
01:18:25,897 --> 01:18:29,355
I've told you many times
not to cheat me like you did my dad

1253
01:18:29,981 --> 01:18:31,772
- 'No, madam, just this once'
- Anna

1254
01:18:31,814 --> 01:18:34,147
- Stop the car....here
- 'I will ensure it isn't repeated'

1255
01:18:46,689 --> 01:18:48,564
Isn't this spot beautiful?

1256
01:18:50,897 --> 01:18:52,230
Nothing has changed

1257
01:18:56,023 --> 01:18:57,522
Without anyone hanging around

1258
01:18:57,689 --> 01:18:59,105
Only you and me

1259
01:19:01,689 --> 01:19:03,188
Don't worry, Sahi

1260
01:19:04,272 --> 01:19:06,939
Doesn't matter if I don't
get back my lost memory

1261
01:19:08,023 --> 01:19:09,105
Tell me why

1262
01:19:09,981 --> 01:19:11,314
You are there for me

1263
01:19:15,272 --> 01:19:16,314
Hoi!

1264
01:19:16,522 --> 01:19:17,647
Why did you stop?

1265
01:19:19,772 --> 01:19:21,230
- Hiiii
- Hey!

1266
01:19:21,689 --> 01:19:23,023
How did you both land here?

1267
01:19:23,814 --> 01:19:26,856
Sadhana hasn't seen Ooty, dude
So I came to show her the lakeside

1268
01:19:27,439 --> 01:19:30,230
Didn't you get any other place?
Do you have to come to the same spot?

1269
01:19:31,147 --> 01:19:32,689
Why didn't you tell me?

1270
01:19:32,772 --> 01:19:34,272
As if you told us and came here!

1271
01:19:34,689 --> 01:19:36,023
Why did you both come here?

1272
01:19:37,439 --> 01:19:40,023
We just wanted to go
for a long drive and look around

1273
01:19:40,147 --> 01:19:41,731
It's been ages, right?

1274
01:19:42,023 --> 01:19:44,689
I was wanting to check
if I remember anything?

1275
01:19:45,147 --> 01:19:47,397
First proper decision of yours
since we came here

1276
01:19:47,439 --> 01:19:48,814
Look around patiently

1277
01:19:53,272 --> 01:19:54,522
Sahi, come...come

1278
01:19:54,647 --> 01:19:55,981
Sit...sit...sit

1279
01:19:56,397 --> 01:19:57,897
This was THE bench!

1280
01:20:00,605 --> 01:20:03,023
I lay down on your lap
in this very bench

1281
01:20:05,814 --> 01:20:06,981
On her lap?!

1282
01:20:07,105 --> 01:20:08,105
Good lord!

1283
01:20:08,147 --> 01:20:10,397
I was lying on your lap
and we had a good time

1284
01:20:12,105 --> 01:20:14,023
They were simply chatting it seems

1285
01:20:15,105 --> 01:20:16,522
Somewhere here

1286
01:20:16,647 --> 01:20:18,147
There must be a bridge

1287
01:20:21,564 --> 01:20:23,064
Can you see that bridge over there?

1288
01:20:23,147 --> 01:20:24,188
'Yes'

1289
01:20:24,814 --> 01:20:27,355
That's a very important spot in our life

1290
01:20:28,480 --> 01:20:29,564
'Right, Sahi?'

1291
01:20:30,480 --> 01:20:32,480
You walked on that bridge
to this lake, huh?

1292
01:20:32,564 --> 01:20:34,147
- Doesn't affect me
- No

1293
01:20:35,605 --> 01:20:37,023
This side is Emerald lake

1294
01:20:37,064 --> 01:20:38,689
- Oh!
- That side, avalanche

1295
01:20:38,772 --> 01:20:39,939
Hahn!

1296
01:20:39,981 --> 01:20:41,314
In between

1297
01:20:41,480 --> 01:20:42,731
Just the two of us

1298
01:20:43,480 --> 01:20:45,105
Sitting literally
glued to each other

1299
01:20:45,480 --> 01:20:47,355
- Oh!
- It was there

1300
01:20:47,897 --> 01:20:49,023
We first

1301
01:20:51,314 --> 01:20:52,355
Kissed

1302
01:20:52,397 --> 01:20:53,605
Aiyaiyo!

1303
01:20:54,272 --> 01:20:55,522
Sun set

1304
01:20:56,564 --> 01:20:58,272
Cool breeze

1305
01:21:00,355 --> 01:21:01,814
It was just magical

1306
01:21:02,314 --> 01:21:03,522
Right, Sahi?

1307
01:21:03,897 --> 01:21:05,897
He remembers everything except you

1308
01:21:06,023 --> 01:21:07,439
'What did you tell her?'

1309
01:21:07,480 --> 01:21:09,772
I was asking her how
you kissed under water?

1310
01:21:09,814 --> 01:21:11,605
You are stunned by just this?

1311
01:21:11,647 --> 01:21:13,439
Follow me
I'll show you something

1312
01:21:13,480 --> 01:21:14,731
'Is that so?'

1313
01:21:16,731 --> 01:21:18,064
Come, we can handle it

1314
01:21:18,522 --> 01:21:19,689
Sahi

1315
01:21:19,731 --> 01:21:20,981
Do you remember?

1316
01:21:21,397 --> 01:21:23,188
- It was behind that bush-
- Dai...dai!

1317
01:21:23,355 --> 01:21:24,814
- I got it
- Hey!

1318
01:21:24,856 --> 01:21:25,897
Dirty mind!

1319
01:21:26,522 --> 01:21:27,939
Behind that bush

1320
01:21:28,147 --> 01:21:30,314
'A wounded puppy was yelping in pain'

1321
01:21:31,772 --> 01:21:33,105
'Sahi and I'

1322
01:21:33,230 --> 01:21:35,023
Admitted the pup in a hospital

1323
01:21:35,897 --> 01:21:37,147
Then what happened?

1324
01:21:37,188 --> 01:21:38,397
After that

1325
01:21:38,731 --> 01:21:40,147
That dog recovered

1326
01:21:40,397 --> 01:21:41,731
Sired 4 pups

1327
01:21:42,397 --> 01:21:43,897
Same way, Sahi and I-

1328
01:21:43,939 --> 01:21:45,064
'My fault, dude'

1329
01:21:45,105 --> 01:21:46,731
Please stop your recollections

1330
01:21:46,772 --> 01:21:48,397
- She is walking away
- Sahi

1331
01:21:49,064 --> 01:21:50,188
- Sahi-
- I'll get her

1332
01:21:50,230 --> 01:21:51,314
- I'll bring her
- Shiva

1333
01:21:51,480 --> 01:21:54,147
Can we go to some place
both of you haven't been to, please?

1334
01:21:55,230 --> 01:21:56,230
You know

1335
01:21:56,272 --> 01:21:58,731
To get a boyfriend who remembers
all these sentimental stuff

1336
01:21:59,147 --> 01:22:00,147
Very rare

1337
01:22:00,897 --> 01:22:02,772
A boyfriend who remembers everything?

1338
01:22:02,981 --> 01:22:04,522
- You?
- Hahn!

1339
01:22:05,522 --> 01:22:06,772
You tell me

1340
01:22:06,814 --> 01:22:07,981
How's your boyfriend?

1341
01:22:08,814 --> 01:22:10,981
You got one?
Or are you single?

1342
01:22:12,897 --> 01:22:13,939
I have

1343
01:22:14,564 --> 01:22:15,647
But I don't have

1344
01:22:15,689 --> 01:22:16,731
That means?

1345
01:22:17,314 --> 01:22:18,647
That means...!

1346
01:22:19,480 --> 01:22:20,814
How do I explain?

1347
01:22:21,480 --> 01:22:23,023
We are truly in love

1348
01:22:23,647 --> 01:22:25,480
But he isn't exactly with me now

1349
01:22:25,564 --> 01:22:27,856
Oh! Like 'taking a break'
That kind of love?

1350
01:22:29,314 --> 01:22:30,605
That's one way of putting it

1351
01:22:30,856 --> 01:22:32,272
Hey! Sorry

1352
01:22:32,731 --> 01:22:34,314
I stirred feelings deep down

1353
01:22:34,731 --> 01:22:35,981
I think I made you feel

1354
01:22:36,064 --> 01:22:37,230
Cha...cha! Not at all

1355
01:22:37,981 --> 01:22:39,188
He'll come back to me

1356
01:22:39,230 --> 01:22:40,397
You bet he will!

1357
01:22:40,522 --> 01:22:42,314
If both of you love truly

1358
01:22:42,355 --> 01:22:43,564
Wherever he is

1359
01:22:43,605 --> 01:22:44,647
Whatever happens

1360
01:22:44,689 --> 01:22:46,439
Your love will unite the two of you

1361
01:22:47,147 --> 01:22:48,689
- Really?
- Of course

1362
01:22:48,814 --> 01:22:50,689
Take our example
Sahithya and me

1363
01:22:51,605 --> 01:22:53,480
We have had so many tiffs

1364
01:22:54,480 --> 01:22:55,814
Wherever she is

1365
01:22:55,856 --> 01:22:56,939
Whatever happens

1366
01:22:57,188 --> 01:22:58,188
I know very well

1367
01:22:58,230 --> 01:22:59,522
We will be back to each other

1368
01:23:00,147 --> 01:23:01,647
Mani...Mani

1369
01:23:01,731 --> 01:23:03,230
- Sahi
- Mani, wait for me

1370
01:23:03,272 --> 01:23:05,023
Sahi...Sahi

1371
01:23:05,355 --> 01:23:07,023
Okay
Here, Sadhana

1372
01:23:07,480 --> 01:23:09,147
- Sahithya?
- No, thanks

1373
01:23:09,689 --> 01:23:10,731
Sahi

1374
01:23:11,272 --> 01:23:12,564
This seems so new to me

1375
01:23:12,856 --> 01:23:14,188
Have we come here?

1376
01:23:14,355 --> 01:23:15,397
No

1377
01:23:21,480 --> 01:23:22,856
Super, eh?

1378
01:23:22,939 --> 01:23:25,397
[Hindi] Bhaiya, give me one more plate

1379
01:23:32,814 --> 01:23:34,272
How did I speak Hindi now?

1380
01:23:37,647 --> 01:23:38,939
How do I know Hindi?

1381
01:23:39,314 --> 01:23:40,939
Are all of you hiding
something from me?

1382
01:23:43,814 --> 01:23:45,314
[Hindi] In big, big countries

1383
01:23:45,355 --> 01:23:47,023
Such small little things
keep happening

1384
01:23:47,064 --> 01:23:48,981
[misquoting the iconic dialog from 'DDLJ']

1385
01:23:49,023 --> 01:23:51,023
Heard that?
Even I speak Hindi

1386
01:23:51,147 --> 01:23:53,314
This is common
Everyone can speak Hindi

1387
01:23:53,355 --> 01:23:56,272
Half the chaat stalls in our country
are run by our 'bhaiyas'

1388
01:23:56,314 --> 01:23:57,397
Enjoy the 'pani puri'

1389
01:24:00,731 --> 01:24:02,064
We bought 3 plates

1390
01:24:02,397 --> 01:24:03,814
Nothing complimentary with this?

1391
01:24:03,939 --> 01:24:05,355
'We bought 3 plates'

1392
01:24:05,397 --> 01:24:07,647
'Nothing complimentary with this?'

1393
01:24:07,689 --> 01:24:09,439
'Nothing complimentary with this?'

1394
01:24:11,564 --> 01:24:12,856
Give me a few

1395
01:24:13,939 --> 01:24:15,605
Hey Shiva...Shiva

1396
01:24:17,272 --> 01:24:20,981
In such cases, memory flash
is a sign of improvement

1397
01:24:21,731 --> 01:24:23,480
He may suffer from headache for awhile

1398
01:24:23,522 --> 01:24:25,522
But he'll be alright in a few hours

1399
01:24:25,731 --> 01:24:28,814
If we go on like this
will he get back his memory, doctor?

1400
01:24:28,897 --> 01:24:31,230
Hahn...he may regain it
in bits and pieces

1401
01:24:31,522 --> 01:24:33,981
But we can't predict
the time frame exactly

1402
01:24:34,272 --> 01:24:36,522
Maybe you can try to
recreate some scenarios

1403
01:24:36,605 --> 01:24:38,522
...which will help trigger his memory

1404
01:24:38,605 --> 01:24:39,772
Okay, doctor

1405
01:24:39,856 --> 01:24:41,230
As far as possible

1406
01:24:41,314 --> 01:24:43,397
Recreate positive, happy moments

1407
01:24:43,480 --> 01:24:44,689
Sure, doctor

1408
01:24:44,897 --> 01:24:46,064
Thank you

1409
01:25:01,731 --> 01:25:02,814
'Dude'

1410
01:25:03,064 --> 01:25:05,272
Isn't Sahithya more beautiful
than our college days?

1411
01:25:06,439 --> 01:25:08,981
Dude, first of all
did you remember anything?

1412
01:25:10,731 --> 01:25:12,230
It came in a whiff

1413
01:25:12,689 --> 01:25:13,689
And disappeared

1414
01:25:13,731 --> 01:25:14,939
Disappeared, huh?

1415
01:25:14,981 --> 01:25:16,689
Okay, da
But did you remember anything?

1416
01:25:17,314 --> 01:25:19,023
My head was splitting

1417
01:25:20,314 --> 01:25:21,731
Do you feel better now?

1418
01:25:22,981 --> 01:25:24,397
Then get up and sit, machan

1419
01:25:24,480 --> 01:25:26,064
Controlling myself for a long time

1420
01:25:26,147 --> 01:25:27,188
Want to pee

1421
01:26:02,272 --> 01:26:03,522
Sahi

1422
01:26:07,814 --> 01:26:11,522
I feel like running away somewhere
instead of managing all this single-handed

1423
01:26:12,939 --> 01:26:14,522
Sahi, don't say that

1424
01:26:15,272 --> 01:26:17,064
This factory, estate

1425
01:26:17,605 --> 01:26:19,939
Watching you run them so smoothly

1426
01:26:20,230 --> 01:26:21,731
I am so proud of you

1427
01:26:31,355 --> 01:26:32,397
What?

1428
01:26:33,188 --> 01:26:34,272
Nothing

1429
01:26:35,731 --> 01:26:37,814
Why should you struggle
doing all this on your own?

1430
01:26:38,564 --> 01:26:40,314
Shall I join you here permanently?

1431
01:26:43,397 --> 01:26:45,522
Will you leave everything and come?

1432
01:26:46,939 --> 01:26:49,023
You say 'okay'
I'll come here

1433
01:26:50,522 --> 01:26:52,147
First you recover fully, okay

1434
01:27:00,981 --> 01:27:02,314
'Shivaaa?'

1435
01:27:03,689 --> 01:27:05,064
'Shiva...?'

1436
01:27:07,731 --> 01:27:09,522
Mutha'nna has made
piping hot cashew fritters

1437
01:27:09,564 --> 01:27:10,939
Delicious, enjoy

1438
01:27:14,064 --> 01:27:15,981
Sadhana, what did the doctor say?

1439
01:27:17,480 --> 01:27:18,522
Doctor

1440
01:27:19,064 --> 01:27:21,188
Wants him to take the tablets
and rest up completely

1441
01:27:21,605 --> 01:27:24,897
He said no one should keep chatting
and disturb him unnecessarily

1442
01:27:26,647 --> 01:27:28,355
He needs deep sleep

1443
01:27:41,480 --> 01:27:42,647
Shiva bhaiya

1444
01:27:43,023 --> 01:27:44,064
Brother?

1445
01:27:48,480 --> 01:27:51,355
"Like a warm cloud vapory
hovering over a stone solitary"

1446
01:27:51,480 --> 01:27:54,814
"I saw you, my soul's deepest memory"

1447
01:27:55,605 --> 01:27:58,897
"Like a monkey on a stone seated
playfully I somersaulted"

1448
01:27:58,939 --> 01:28:01,814
"Thanks to you, I felt accepted"

1449
01:28:01,897 --> 01:28:04,147
"O jasmine, blooming on the hill"

1450
01:28:05,397 --> 01:28:08,939
"Is your love a stubborn spirit still?"

1451
01:28:09,064 --> 01:28:11,314
"Daily stirs confusion contrary"

1452
01:28:11,731 --> 01:28:13,731
ANKITHAAA!

1453
01:28:13,814 --> 01:28:16,314
"Kindly shower me with mercy
Come, rescue me from my misery"

1454
01:28:16,355 --> 01:28:20,397
"The maiden from this tea-estate
nestled in my heart, my soul-mate"

1455
01:28:20,480 --> 01:28:23,522
"Slowly, softly, gently
she sprayed love soulfully"

1456
01:28:23,564 --> 01:28:27,731
"Lord Vishnu's consort, by divine grace
between heaven & earth I float in a daze"

1457
01:28:27,856 --> 01:28:30,689
"Kindly do not ask me
to come down to reality"

1458
01:28:30,731 --> 01:28:34,981
"I cast a spell on hamlets within my view
to keep other hearts from going mad too"

1459
01:28:35,023 --> 01:28:37,564
"Kindly do not kill me
by an intoxicating spree"

1460
01:28:37,605 --> 01:28:41,272
"Garlanding Lord Muruga I pray
I go in circles in a frenzied sway"

1461
01:28:41,314 --> 01:28:44,814
"Won't the Lord I trust with all my heart
unite me with my long lost sweetheart?"

1462
01:28:44,856 --> 01:28:48,439
"Outpourings of my soul tucked in, I pour
All my love in a string of rosary encore"

1463
01:28:48,480 --> 01:28:52,272
"Won't the angel I love with all my heart
reciprocate her feelings; never to part?"

1464
01:29:09,355 --> 01:29:10,439
Enough...enough

1465
01:29:14,064 --> 01:29:17,272
"Cold winds pierce with a needle's sting
where misty waters ripple as spring"

1466
01:29:17,314 --> 01:29:20,023
"Let us spend quality time, you & me
Make magic happen happily"

1467
01:29:21,188 --> 01:29:24,230
"In the forest where the tuskers roam
where mountain bees have built a home"

1468
01:29:24,272 --> 01:29:28,023
"Let us cuddle and canoodle together
Make a million tiny hearts, now & forever"

1469
01:29:28,064 --> 01:29:30,230
"Wild rose in the jungle here"

1470
01:29:30,272 --> 01:29:34,981
"Southwest blooms, I’ll gather near
to string a garland for you, my dear"

1471
01:29:35,023 --> 01:29:39,023
"Nectar honey within my reach are you
I will keep you happy lifetime through"

1472
01:29:39,064 --> 01:29:42,314
"With your tender feet resting
on my lap warm and comforting"

1473
01:30:04,564 --> 01:30:07,522
"Like a warm cloud vapory
hovering over a stone solitary"

1474
01:30:07,564 --> 01:30:11,188
"I saw you, my soul's deepest memory"

1475
01:30:11,731 --> 01:30:15,023
"Like a monkey on a stone seated
playfully I somersaulted"

1476
01:30:15,064 --> 01:30:17,939
"Thanks to you, I felt elevated"

1477
01:30:18,023 --> 01:30:20,147
"O jasmine, blooming on the hill"

1478
01:30:21,564 --> 01:30:25,147
"Is your love a stubborn spirit still?"

1479
01:30:25,188 --> 01:30:27,439
"Daily stirs confusion contrary"

1480
01:30:28,772 --> 01:30:32,647
"Kindly shower me with mercy
Come, rescue me from my misery"

1481
