I go in circles in a frenzied sway"

1488
01:30:57,480 --> 01:31:00,939
"Won't the Lord I trust with all my heart
unite me with my long lost sweetheart?"

1489
01:31:00,981 --> 01:31:04,564
"Outpourings of my soul tucked in, I pour
All my love in a string of rosary encore"

1490
01:31:04,647 --> 01:31:08,355
"Won't the angel I love with all my heart
reciprocate her feelings; never to part?"

1491
01:31:19,064 --> 01:31:20,480
[Hindi] Don't be so worried

1492
01:31:20,522 --> 01:31:22,397
- Bhaiya will recover soon, ma'am
- Okay

1493
01:31:22,480 --> 01:31:23,439
Guys

1494
01:31:23,480 --> 01:31:25,023
Just a few more days
I'll call you back

1495
01:31:25,064 --> 01:31:27,064
- Good news for you
- What?

1496
01:31:30,314 --> 01:31:31,605
We are engaged

1497
01:31:33,480 --> 01:31:34,605
Meaning?

1498
01:31:36,731 --> 01:31:37,897
What do you mean?

1499
01:31:39,397 --> 01:31:40,564
That means

1500
01:31:42,314 --> 01:31:43,647
We are getting married

1501
01:31:44,064 --> 01:31:45,314
Wedding bells

1502
01:31:46,647 --> 01:31:47,897
Sahithya

1503
01:31:47,939 --> 01:31:49,647
What is he blabbering?
Is it true?

1504
01:31:52,355 --> 01:31:53,439
Hey!

1505
01:31:53,689 --> 01:31:57,023
I thought you'll be happy for me
Instead, you're questioning us?

1506
01:31:59,064 --> 01:32:00,147
Congrats!

1507
01:32:00,188 --> 01:32:01,605
Shiva and...Sahithya

1508
01:32:01,647 --> 01:32:02,814
'Thank you'

1509
01:32:06,064 --> 01:32:07,522
- Congrats, dude
- Thanks, machan

1510
01:32:07,564 --> 01:32:09,981
- I hope you'll invite me
- How can I get married without you?

1511
01:32:10,023 --> 01:32:11,939
- You are my best man
- Informed your family?

1512
01:32:11,981 --> 01:32:13,314
Fixed the wedding date?

1513
01:32:13,355 --> 01:32:15,731
I have to, come
First let me call my parents

1514
01:32:16,564 --> 01:32:17,647
Sadhana?

1515
01:32:18,023 --> 01:32:19,397
What is this, Sahithya?

1516
01:32:20,397 --> 01:32:23,272
If I say 'no', I know
how he will react

1517
01:32:23,814 --> 01:32:26,064
It isn't tough for you
to cut him off from your life

1518
01:32:26,355 --> 01:32:27,605
He barged into my estate-

1519
01:32:27,647 --> 01:32:29,814
What if he proposes?
Why did you accept the ring?

1520
01:32:29,856 --> 01:32:31,439
Do you think I want this?

1521
01:32:31,647 --> 01:32:33,605
I'm neck deep in this charade for your sake

1522
01:32:33,647 --> 01:32:35,814
Siva has to recover, right?
Have you forgotten that?

1523
01:32:36,355 --> 01:32:37,981
Please don't give me this attitude

1524
01:32:38,897 --> 01:32:40,897
Oh! Shiva has to recover, no?

1525
01:32:41,314 --> 01:32:43,147
Then you take care
and help him recover

1526
01:32:49,522 --> 01:32:51,480
Take Shiva and leave, Mani

1527
01:32:53,939 --> 01:32:55,023
What happened, Sahi?

1528
01:32:55,314 --> 01:32:57,314
He's slowly recovering
and getting back to normalcy

1529
01:32:57,355 --> 01:32:58,689
You don't get it, Mani

1530
01:33:00,564 --> 01:33:03,439
No matter how much
I ignore him and move away

1531
01:33:03,522 --> 01:33:05,814
He follows me like a lost pup

1532
01:33:05,981 --> 01:33:07,480
I feel...it's déjà vu

1533
01:33:10,188 --> 01:33:12,439
I'm starting to like all this, Mani

1534
01:33:14,647 --> 01:33:17,064
I'm saying it because
I don't want to think that way

1535
01:33:22,064 --> 01:33:25,439
It's better for all of us
if you leave right away, today

1536
01:33:51,647 --> 01:33:52,981
What are you thinking?

1537
01:33:53,689 --> 01:33:56,272
I can't stick around
watching him go gaga over her, Mani

1538
01:33:58,522 --> 01:34:01,230
If you want, I'll hit him
on his head with a pounding stone

1539
01:34:01,814 --> 01:34:03,355
Either he regains his memory

1540
01:34:04,105 --> 01:34:05,564
Or his chapter closes, end of story

1541
01:34:05,605 --> 01:34:07,230
I have a better idea
Hit her instead

1542
01:34:08,439 --> 01:34:09,647
No, Mani

1543
01:34:10,731 --> 01:34:12,064
I feel terrible

1544
01:34:12,147 --> 01:34:15,023
I don't know if I can
stick around here any longer

1545
01:34:18,981 --> 01:34:20,731
You came here well aware
of what's in store

1546
01:34:22,064 --> 01:34:23,814
I know I came
with my eyes wide open

1547
01:34:23,981 --> 01:34:26,480
But it doesn't look like
he will ever remember his past

1548
01:34:26,522 --> 01:34:28,564
Will he remember everything
if you aren't here?

1549
01:34:29,939 --> 01:34:31,272
I don't know all that

1550
01:34:32,522 --> 01:34:35,064
But he will be happy
prancing around with Sahithya

1551
01:34:36,314 --> 01:34:37,439
Sahi

1552
01:34:38,522 --> 01:34:39,731
Sahi

1553
01:34:41,147 --> 01:34:42,731
Hey...dai!

1554
01:34:44,272 --> 01:34:45,605
Aiyo!

1555
01:34:53,188 --> 01:34:55,272
What do you think
when you look at stars now?

1556
01:34:59,772 --> 01:35:01,355
If I look at these stars

1557
01:35:02,897 --> 01:35:04,064
I think only of you

1558
01:35:05,605 --> 01:35:06,689
Is that so?

1559
01:35:12,439 --> 01:35:13,564
Do you know this?

1560
01:35:14,856 --> 01:35:17,522
When people die
they turn into stars

1561
