1722
01:43:59,981 --> 01:44:01,023
What?

1723
01:44:01,064 --> 01:44:02,105
No, huh?

1724
01:44:03,564 --> 01:44:04,731
Shiva

1725
01:44:08,981 --> 01:44:12,647
How someone can love selflessly

1726
01:44:12,731 --> 01:44:14,564
I learnt only from you

1727
01:44:17,772 --> 01:44:20,272
You've actually been there for me

1728
01:44:24,355 --> 01:44:25,814
Stop crying

1729
01:44:26,105 --> 01:44:27,397
No...no...no, it's okay

1730
01:44:27,439 --> 01:44:29,147
- Nothing
- Why are you feeling sad?

1731
