- Shiva
- I won't go anywhere without you

1732
01:44:33,605 --> 01:44:34,731
Okay?

1733
01:44:35,188 --> 01:44:36,355
Okay...okay

1734
01:44:40,397 --> 01:44:41,522
Were you always

1735
