'Sadhana, let's talk it over
1 minute, open the door'

1753
01:45:55,647 --> 01:45:56,939
'Sadhana'

1754
01:46:00,023 --> 01:46:01,188
Sadhana

1755
01:46:01,647 --> 01:46:02,897
Sadhana

1756
01:46:06,355 --> 01:46:07,731
'1 minute, please open the door'

1757
01:46:09,897 --> 01:46:10,981
'Sadhana'

1758
01:46:11,981 --> 01:46:13,105
Sadhana

1759
01:46:18,939 --> 01:46:20,064
Hear me out, Sadhana

1760
01:46:20,105 --> 01:46:21,147
- Hey!
- Sadhana

1761
