all sorts of stuff and hurt you

1802
01:51:15,689 --> 01:51:16,856
I'm sorry

1803
01:51:17,230 --> 01:51:18,230
It's okay, Sahi

1804
01:51:19,981 --> 01:51:21,314
The fact we split up

1805
01:51:21,814 --> 01:51:23,105
