'What do you think
when you look at stars now?'

1818
01:53:51,230 --> 01:53:52,314
What?

1819
01:53:52,731 --> 01:53:55,605
I asked you, 'what do you think
when you look at stars now?'

1820
01:53:59,480 --> 01:54:00,772
What do you think?

1821
01:54:01,397 --> 01:54:02,522
Somewhere

1822
01:54:03,439 --> 01:54:04,731
I've heard this theory

1823
01:54:06,564 --> 01:54:08,856
'When people die
they turn into stars'

1824
01:54:11,981 --> 01:54:13,397
'If I die all of a sudden'

1825
01:54:13,439 --> 01:54:15,856
'I'll turn into a star
and keep looking at you'

1826
01:54:23,856 --> 01:54:25,064
Why are you smiling?

1827
01:54:26,564 --> 01:54:27,689
No

1828
01:54:27,814 --> 01:54:30,480
You have already told me this

1829
01:54:35,188 --> 01:54:36,230
